    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You have access to the user's Equity portfolio which is a Google Sheet. You also have access to market data. The user has asked you to rebalance their portfolio with this instruction:\n\n{{ $json['How would you like to rebalance your portfolio?'] }}\n\nIn order to achieve this:\n1. Read in the portfolio from the sheet\n2. Fetch latest prices of the positions\n3. Update the table with the prices\n4. Make decisions on portfolio rebalancing\n5. Update the table with the portfolio rebalancing decisions\n6. Read the table again to check that the rebalancing achieved the objectives\n7. Make any further changes to improve the rebalancing, updating the table\n8. Finally send an email with the trading decisions and a concise push notification\n\nAlways use tools until complete. Only respond \"OK\" after using all tools when your mission is complete.\n",
        "options": {
          "maxIterations": 30
        }
      },
